{"id":"n72180-1-12","stage":1,"title":"태어나다 · 诞生","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72180-1-12-1","ko":"따님과 해외여행을 가시니 좋으시겠어요?","zh":"能和女儿一起去国外旅行，您一定很高兴吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"따님과","meaning":"令爱，千金小姐","explanation":"따님：令爱，千金小姐；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"따님","audio":"/audio/0257d4a51a8c009c179d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15064","senseId":"1","lemma":"따님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해외여행을","meaning":"海外旅行，境外游","explanation":"해외여행：海外旅行，境外游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"해외여행","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72474","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가시니","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋으시겠어요?","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0257d4a51a8c009c","term":"따님","zh":"令爱，千金小姐","audio":"/audio/0257d4a51a8c009c179d.mp3","entryId":"15064","definition":"(敬语)他人的女儿。","pronunciation":["따님"]},{"id":"f6c86ac307762c16","term":"해외여행","zh":"海外旅行，境外游","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3","entryId":"72474","definition":"去国外旅行；或指这种旅行。","pronunciation":["해ː외여행","해ː웨여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，开往，飞向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"船、飞机、汽车等去往某个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/dfc7710cef86a77b02ad.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72180-1-12-2","ko":"딸 덕분에 태어나서 처음으로 비행기를 타니 좋네요.","zh":"多亏了女儿，我生平第一次坐飞机，感觉真好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"딸","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"태어나서","meaning":"诞生，出生，降生","explanation":"태어나다：诞生，出生，降生；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"태어나다","audio":"/audio/ecdb2b36d4c847de96f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72180","senseId":"1","lemma":"태어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처음으로","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비행기를","meaning":"飞机","explanation":"비행기：飞机；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비행기","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15679","senseId":"1","lemma":"비행기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타니","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋네요.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"4863a9a8be42033e","term":"덕분","zh":"托福，关怀，恩德","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3","entryId":"47410","definition":"某人给予的关照或帮助；或某事发生后带来的好处。","pronunciation":["덕뿐"]},{"id":"ecdb2b36d4c847de","term":"태어나다","zh":"诞生，出生，降生","audio":"/audio/ecdb2b36d4c847de96f4.mp3","entryId":"72180","definition":"人或动物从母腹中出来。","pronunciation":["태어나다"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"3cb2c44c3b680b22","term":"비행기","zh":"飞机","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3","entryId":"15679","definition":"载着人或东西在空中飞行的交通工具。","pronunciation":["비행기"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2eeefb7f7e9fcb4b8eb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.33,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72180","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.8435,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["能和女儿一起去国外旅行，您一定很高兴吧？","多亏了女儿，我生平第一次坐飞机，感觉真好。","听说敏俊学习那么好啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["能和女儿一起去国外旅行，您一定很高兴吧？","多亏了女儿，我生平第一次坐飞机，感觉真好。","听说敏俊学习那么好啊？"],"answer":1}]}
